{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“熟悉的感觉又回来”和“过去也回不来”描述的是主观熟悉感及过去不可复返，没有把旧场景写成他真实想起的往事，也没有新增具体经历或音乐术语。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"不甘心、硬撑、想停和害怕失去都是心理状态，“硬撑着不肯垮下去”没有落实为真的挺直背脊或倒下等身体动作。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"寻找理由、刚觉得想通又生出舍不得、说不清舍不得什么都属于心理活动，没有把珠子中的身体迈步或旧场景写成真实行动或回忆。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"这一条只概括他因非得想透才肯行动而感到难堪，没有增加具体场景、对白、人物关系或外部事件。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"不看珠子也能读出他先有不明所以的牵引，继而在不甘心照旧与害怕投入后失去之间拉扯，试图想清却又被舍不得打断，最后为自己非得想透才行动而难堪。\",\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R4\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"修补后保留了刚觉得想通又被舍不得打断的反复，也写出了舍不得的对象不明，但没有保留“确信也变陌生”这一层，即他不只是难以确定结论，连原先的确信本身也开始变得陌生。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S01-1\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"这一条把不肯停的劲、熟悉感回返、身体先被牵动、说不清在等什么、过去回不来五层内容并列塞入，其中“身体先被牵动”偏重重复珠子的身体化画面，整条显得为覆盖多颗珠子而过满。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S01-3\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"“说服自己该不该往前走”搭配不够自然，像把“说服自己往前走”和“判断该不该往前走”两种说法拼在了一起。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f9fab94c-0ed7-4e49-a2ca-940311cda790", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T145840263750Z", "elapsed_seconds": 708.219, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T15:10:28.486131+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "38f9af3cf8c7ea74a9c2b726bca2ef12613ce0427da153caf92cc70c3c8f7f8a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T145840263750Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "f6cb0a3e9cf918e9606e22657f64545b256d9867f94528a4ef0d7f35e2e4efe0"}}}
